        "canBeReferencedInPrompt": true,
        "modelDescription": "Complete an explicitly requested single named role scope. Optional skills selects exact installed current workspace skill names with host-pinned receipts and files; omit for ordinary tools. Whole-product acceptance is not implied by a scoped professional report.",
